Subject: [PATCH V4 20/21] perf: make events stream always parsable
Date: Thu,  4 Jul 2013 16:20:39 +0300
Message-Id: <1372944040-32690-21-git-send-email-adrian.hunter@intel.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 1.7.11.7
In-Reply-To: <1372944040-32690-1-git-send-email-adrian.hunter@intel.com>
References: <1372944040-32690-1-git-send-email-adrian.hunter@intel.com>
Organization: Intel Finland Oy, Registered Address: PL 281, 00181 Helsinki, Business Identity Code: 0357606 - 4, Domiciled in Helsinki
